      "url": "https://www.encryptdecrypt.org/llms.txt",
      "description": "Comprehensive client-side suite for AES-256-GCM/CBC encryption, RSA, SHA-256, SHA-512, MD5, HMAC, JWT debugging, Base64/Hex/URL encoding, UUID v4/v7, and developer utilities running 100% in local browser RAM.",
